# Code Smell Prevention

Rules to eliminate recurring code smells found in this project. Every new or modified file must comply.

---

## No Magic Numbers or Hardcoded Values

Every literal number that represents a domain concept must be a named constant.

### Timing Delays

```ts
// BAD
setTimeout(() => startTurn(), 3000);
this.nextTurnStartDelay = 1500;
const leaderboardDelay = lastColumnResultHadDealerBust ? 5000 : 3000;

// GOOD
const TIMING = {
  TURN_START_DELAY: 3000,
  RECONNECT_TURN_START_DELAY: 1000,
  LEADERBOARD_DELAY_DEFAULT: 3000,
  LEADERBOARD_DELAY_DEALER_BUST: 5000,
  NEXT_TURN_START_DELAY: 1500,
} as const;

setTimeout(() => startTurn(), TIMING.TURN_START_DELAY);
```

All timing constants belong in `constants/timing.ts`.

### Colors and Theming

```ts
// BAD — colors scattered across 30+ files
houseGradient.addColorStop(0, 0xe8e8e8);
fill: "#00FF00";
textColor: 0xffffff;

// GOOD — centralized in constants/theme.ts
export const COLORS = {
  WHITE: 0xffffff,
  BLACK: 0x000000,
  BACKGROUND_DARK: 0x151515,
  SUCCESS_GREEN: 0x00ff00,
  ERROR_RED: 0xff0000,
  GRADIENT_LIGHT: 0xe8e8e8,
  GRADIENT_MID: 0xffffff,
  GRADIENT_DARK: 0xc0c0c0,
} as const;
```

All color values belong in `constants/theme.ts`. Use hex number format (`0xRRGGBB`) consistently — never mix with string format (`"#RRGGBB"`).

### Pixel Positions and Sizes

UI layout magic numbers must be named constants, ideally in the component's file or in `constants/layout.ts`:

```ts
// BAD
{ x: -this.circleSize / 2 - 3, y: 0 }
maxWidth: 400,
fontSize: 24,

// GOOD
const TOOLTIP_CONFIG = { maxWidth: 400, textColor: COLORS.WHITE, fontSize: 24 } as const;
const CIRCLE_OFFSET = 3;
```

### Hardcoded URLs

URLs must come from environment config or `network/constants.ts`, never inlined:

```ts
// BAD
"https://d36pvm6vh2iaub.cloudfront.net/avatars/1.png"

// GOOD
const DEFAULT_AVATAR_URL = PARTNER_SPECIFIC_CONFIG[CURRENT_PARTNER].defaultAvatarUrl;
```

