## No Code Duplication (DRY)

If the same logic exists in more than one place, extract it immediately.

### Rules
- A function or block of logic must exist in **exactly one place**. If two files need it, extract to a shared utility.
- When two classes share >30% of their code, extract a shared base class or composition helper.
- Never copy-paste a class to create a mode variant (Duel vs Tournament). Use inheritance or generics.

### Known Duplications to Eliminate

| Duplicated Logic | Current Locations | Extract To |
|---|---|---|
| `convertColumnResult()` | `eventListeners.ts`, `TournamentGameScreen.ts` | `utils/columnResult.ts` |
| `shouldShowFTUEPointers()` | `GameScreen.ts`, `TournamentGameScreen.ts`, `PhaseTwo.ts`, `TournamentPhaseTwo.ts` | `utils/ftue.ts` |
| `dispatchProgress()` | `main.ts`, `app.ts` | `utils/progress.ts` |
| GameScreen class body | `GameScreen.ts`, `TournamentGameScreen.ts` | `BaseGameScreen.ts` abstract class |
| PhaseOne class body | `PhaseOne.ts`, `TournamentPhaseOne.ts` | `BasePhaseOne.ts` abstract class |
| PhaseTwo class body | `PhaseTwo.ts`, `TournamentPhaseTwo.ts` | `BasePhaseTwo.ts` abstract class |

