## No God Methods

Methods must be small, focused, and easy to understand at a glance.

### Rules
- **Constructors: max ~50 lines.** Delegate complex setup to private `init*` or `setup*` methods or builder classes.
- **Methods: max ~40 lines.** If a method exceeds this, extract sub-steps into private helpers with descriptive names.
- **Max 3 levels of nesting.** Use early returns, guard clauses, and extracted helpers to flatten logic.

```ts
// BAD — 200-line constructor
constructor(data: StoreData) {
  super();
  // ... 200 lines of mixed layout, state, event wiring, timers, FTUE ...
}

// GOOD — constructor delegates
constructor(data: StoreData) {
  super();
  this.state = this.initState(data);
  this.initLayout();
  this.initEventListeners();
}
```

