## No Dead Code

### Rules
- Remove unused imports, variables, classes, and functions. Do not leave them "for later."
- Remove all commented-out code blocks. Use version control to recover old code if needed.
- Remove test stubs and dummy data from production source. Move to a `__tests__/` or `__fixtures__/` directory.

### Known Dead Code
- `store/StoreManager.ts` and `store/Practice.ts` — `gameStore` appears entirely unused by actual game logic
- `store/dummyDataForLobbies.ts` — test fixture in production source
- `ui/test.ts` and `ui/test/` — test harness in production UI directory
- Commented-out blocks in `SocketManager.ts` (lines 214-224)

